  "description": "Flexible and configuration-driven CNAB to JSON converter for .NET. Provides a static, high-performance API (no DI required) that parses banking files based on layouts defined in appsettings.json. Returns a standardized response with validation flags (Success, CompletelyConverted) and structured data, handling Headers, Details, and Trailers dynamically without hardcoded logic.",
